        ⟹ ⛔ NO Aut-block is a single gauge-orbit — every block splits into >= 2 gauge-orbits, so even a PERFECT key leaves >= 2 reps ⟹ THE CELL CANNOT FIRE on the gauge (block/gauge ratio 4)
     cell 1 [wires]: |cell|=24
        gauge-orbits: 12 sizes=[2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2]
        Aut-orbits  : 3 sizes=[12, 6, 6]
        ⟹ ⛔ NOT linear: Aut merges 12 gauge-orbits into 3 blocks
           the extra merging is BASE automorphism structure, which no linear
